#
# REVISION HISTORY
#   rev 1  2026-10-03  20 entries. Superseded: it froze `.env.example` and
#                   `playwright.config.ts` while simultaneously instructing the
#                   implementer to edit both, and it did not freeze the five
#                   pre-existing suites that were revised during the combined
#                   preparation correction (docs/reviews/F-02-preparation.md,
#                   finding P1). It also predated the P3/P4/P5 corrections to the
#                   six F-02 acceptance files, the addendum and the feature spec,
#                   so seven of its entries no longer matched.
#   rev 2  2026-10-03  24 entries. Changes only, no re-implementation:
#                   - REMOVED `.env.example` and `playwright.config.ts`
#                     (writable implementation configuration; see the ownership
#                     table in specs/003-demo-auth/spec.md).
#                   - ADDED `tests/fixtures/f02-demo-credentials.json` (committed
#                     synthetic demo-only credential fixture, finding P6) and the
#                     five pre-existing suites revised to establish a genuine
#                     authenticated precondition (finding P2):
#                       apps/tablet/src/__tests__/foundation.test.tsx
#                       apps/admin/src/__tests__/foundation.test.tsx
#                       apps/tablet/e2e/foundation.spec.ts
#                       apps/admin/e2e/foundation.spec.ts
#                       tests/e2e/api-proxy.spec.ts
#                     Every original label, touch-target, health-contract,
#                     invalid-payload and route assertion in those five files is
#                     preserved; only setup and precondition handling changed.
#                   - REFRESHED the hashes of the seven rev-1 entries that the
#                     correction batch legitimately changed.
#
# This manifest is NEW and separate. It does not modify, replace or extend any
# earlier baseline:
#   docs/handoffs/S-01-tests.sha256          11 entries  (foundation)
#   docs/handoffs/F-01-tests.sha256          14 entries  (F-01 original approval)
#   docs/handoffs/F-01-corrections-tests.sha256 10 entries (F-01 additive revisions)
# All three must continue to verify unchanged. See the "Baseline verification"
# section of docs/handoffs/F-02-prepared.md for the one documented divergence in
# docs/reviews/F-01-accepted.sha256, which is a planning-document delta and is
# NOT edited here or in that manifest.
#
# Mutable implementation evidence (docs/handoffs/F-02.md, feature tasks.md) is
# deliberately EXCLUDED, as are the historical review reports and the writable
# configuration files.
#
# Do not regenerate this manifest to fix a failure. Return test defects to the
# planner with concrete evidence. Any further revision is a numbered rev with its
# own recorded reason.
